+Source: base 60e287a, head 8f8ec53 (both verified as commits). Cluster files: evidence/hg-lnw.12/cargo-test.log and evidence/hg-lnw.12/check-all.log (slices 000033, 000034).
+
+## Evidence validity
+
+- The head tree (d59a41f) is identical to the tree of e8b6e69, the commit that added both logs. The logs were produced on exactly the code at the reviewed head, not a stale revision.
+- cargo-test.log: lib 1536 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored. integration_sweep 27 passed, daemon_composed 22 passed, test_isolation 17 passed. The only ignored test is the opt-in release build in packaging. No failure lines anywhere.
+- The lib count (1536) matches the hg-lnw.23 rebased log (1536), consistent with the hg-lnw.12 commit adding only integration tests and a fake fix.
+- check-all.log: cargo check of herdr-threads 3.6.0 and herdr-graph, exit 0. One dead_code warning (Fx.herdr in src/threads/tests.rs:245), warning only.
+- The two logs name the task worktree path in compile lines. That is expected provenance for a task-branch run, not a defect.
+
