+
+- The bead acceptance asks for cargo test (tiers 1-2) green in hg-build with no rig leak. The log shows green. The log does not record the post-run leak check from AGENTS.md; test_isolation passing (17) covers the rig lifecycle but is not the pgrep check.
+- The flow-to-test pointers (keyed close and undo, keyless windows, cold restart) live in the bead and commit message, not in this cluster. The test code is tests/integration_sweep.rs, outside this cluster.
+- Requirement baseline rows B1 to B4 are production behavior in src and tests, outside this evidence-only cluster. They are the seam and source reviewers' to trace; this cluster neither delivers nor undermines them.
