+## Observations
+
+- threads_real, e2e_private_herdr, herdr_client, herdr_spikes, adopt_private_herdr show 0 tests in this log (feature or env gated), so tier 3 and tier 5 real-Herdr and real-threads behavior is not exercised by this evidence. Other clusters (hg-lnw.9, .22, .23) carry tier 3 and tier 5 logs.
